==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**15 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is just a generic Bun Bun fight with light Aku support. Using general strategies against a lone Bun Bun will do the trick fine here. Sinner Snache's Death Surge might wipe out a stack here and there, but it's nothing simple spam won't fix.

